async function openReaderFromPlayer(){if(currentSurah<0){toastWarning('اختر سورة أولاً');return;}if(isReaderOpen){toastInfo('نافذة القراءة مفتوحة بالفعل');return;}const targetSurah=currentSurah;let targetAyah=null;if(isPlaying&&audio.currentTime>0&&SYNC_READERS[currentReader]){let timing=currentTiming;if(!timing){timing=await loadTimingData(currentReader,targetSurah);}if(timing&&timing.verse_timings){const t=audio.currentTime*1000;let curAyah=null;for(let i=0;i<timing.verse_timings.length;i++){const v=timing.verse_timings[i];if(t>=v.timestamp_from)curAyah=v;else break;}if(curAyah)targetAyah=parseInt(curAyah.verse_key.split(':')[1],10);}}if(targetAyah)openReaderWithAyah(targetSurah,targetAyah);else openReader(targetSurah);}
function openReaderFromCard(idx){if(idx<0||idx>113){toastError('رقم سورة غير صحيح');return;}openReader(idx);}
function updateFooterHeight(){const f=$('fixedFooter');if(!f)return;const fh=f.offsetHeight;document.documentElement.style.setProperty('--footer-height',fh+'px');if(currentSurah>=0&&!isRadio){const p=$('bottomPlayer');if(p&&p.classList.contains('visible')){p.style.bottom=fh+'px';document.body.style.paddingBottom=(fh+p.offsetHeight+32)+'px';}}}
